  "description": "Provides full-featured Oracle Database support for TuanZi's Entity Framework Core implementation, including:\n\t\t\t- Oracle EF Core provider integration\n\t\t\t- Oracle-specific data type mappings\n\t\t\t- Optimized Oracle connection management\n\t\t\t- Oracle sequence and identity value handling\n\t\t\t- Oracle-specific SQL generation\n\t\t\t- Support for Oracle-specific features (JSON, Spatial, etc.)\n\t\t\t- Compatibility with major Oracle Database versions\n\t\t\t- Seamless integration with TuanZi data access patterns",
